=== D. is SplitMix64 copied, or independently typed from its paper? ===
  (SplitMix64 is a published routine, so shared presence alone proves
   nothing. Whitespace-normalised hash of each declaration-to-brace body:)
  bitpack-carrier-shared     1d5b8ba5f58f
  bitpack-footprint-shared   1d5b8ba5f58f
  bitpack-shared             6530b511637a
